Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:04.34,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Good work on your \Ncompetition entries, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.34,0:00:06.17,Main,Everyone,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:07.29,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Who's up for round two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:07.98,Main,Ishiyama,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:10.81,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, do you want to \Nwalk to the station toge—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:12.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:14.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Once we're done...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:18.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,would you like to come do \Nsomething naughty with your senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.75,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Something naughty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:24.12,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There's a senpai where I work...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:29.45,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,who's tiny and sexy—I mean... cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.51,Main,Chef,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:34.51,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:38.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,After having some drinks... late at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:43.41,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I know it's bad for you, \Nbut I can't resist the sweet siren call...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:44.94,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,of ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:46.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what she meant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:49.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Aren't you going to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:52.94,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's just... I didn't expect ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:55.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What did you expect, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:00.03,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she doing this on purpose, \Nor accidentally?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:03.29,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(424,207)\bord0\shad0\fnArial\b1\c&HECFAFD&}Stray Ramen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:03.29,Main,Chef,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:05.79,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thank you for treating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:09.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You worked really hard on your contest entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:12.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's not much, but I wanted to \Nreward you, as your senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:14.29,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:20.30,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's nice and always looking out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.15,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that makes me so happy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:30.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are we always just going to be \Nsenpai and kohai?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:32.42,Main,Couple Man,0,0,0,,Man, I am starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:34.98,Main,Couple Girl,0,0,0,,Y'know what they say about ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:33.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:38.41,Main,Couple Girl,0,0,0,,If someone craves ramen late at night, \Nthey've got a strong libido.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.41,0:01:41.06,Main,Couple Man,0,0,0,,What the heck? Like they're not satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:42.21,Main,Couple Girl,0,0,0,,Yep, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:49.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I was really just looking \Nfor some refreshing tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:52.36,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,R-Right! Tea! I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.01,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Anyway! You were about to say something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:57.31,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-It can wait until some other time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:05.08,Italics - Top,Lyrics,0,0,0,,Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:14.70,Show_Title,Title sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H292A2F&\bord0}My {\1a&HFF&\bord1\3c&HA183CA&}T{\3c&H000000&}iny {\bord0\1a&H00&}Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:17.78,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We've got an emergency here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:20.56,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Are you paying attention, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:26.79,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}There's someone other than me \Ndancing around inside of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:29.04,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I want to talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:32.08,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I want to touch her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:37.58,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:40.80,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}What in the world am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:43.55,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You're right next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:49.81,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And this is the perfect chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:51.39,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:56.10,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:59.31,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And I don't think I can ever escape
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.31,0:03:01.81,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I may as well just sink into it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:02.64,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:07.41,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It's another day in your dazzling presence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:10.41,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We may never be \Non the same page with this love but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:16.85,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:32.98,Episode_Title,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(38,310)\an1}#12 {\fscx80}A Story About the {\c&H856CC3&}Tiny {\c}Senpai Where I Work
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:31.73,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hayakawa-san, you headed for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:34.23,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mind if I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:39.83,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}My boss at my job... is pleasant \Nand friendly to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:42.20,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Okay... sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:43.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:48.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Going to lunch together... \NIs this a lunch date?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.38,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:54.25,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Yep, yep! Let's call it a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.37,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Don't say something like that at the office!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:04:00.01,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,What if people start spreading weird rumors?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:02.78,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Considering it's you, Hayakawa-san, \NI wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:10.21,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-Wh-Wh-What's that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:13.58,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}Considering who said it, \Nit's probably nothing significant, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:17.69,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Ugh! You just had to \Nsay something, Katase-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:19.69,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.32,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I found my wallet, so let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.60,Main,Manager/Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It's a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:25.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:28.72,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Zakishino!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:31.95,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)\pos(494,294)\b1\c&H7F007C&\3c&HE4E7EF&\shad0\fs14}Rainbow Sweet Potato Tarts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:31.95,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,{\i1}Mensore{\i0}! Here's some Okinawa stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:33.45,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:36.21,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy the resort?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:39.89,Flashback,Ishiyama,0,0,0,,Are you hitting on me? \NAw, but I've got a girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.89,0:04:40.71,Flashback,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,{\i1}Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:44.61,Flashback,Masatan,0,0,0,,I was transferred, \Nbut I used my paid time off, Yuri-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:46.60,Flashback,Yuritan,0,0,0,,I'm so glad, Masa-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:48.35,Flashback,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,{\i1}Who even does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:51.50,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,It was... a real blast...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:55.26,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Console me, Zakishino!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:56.85,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:05:00.11,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Could I bug you for a bit after work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:04.61,Sign_Basic,BG Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(332,36)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\c&H92D5E5&\bord0\b1\4c&H456070&\shad2}40th Anniversary
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.61,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,A Meowtaro game?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:09.87,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,{\an8}Yep! My anthropomorphized \Nhottie Meowtaro game is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:09.87,Sign_Basic,Start Menu Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnImpact\b1\3c&HECFC80&\fs20\move(186,140,200,142)\t(\fscx90\fscy90)}Doki Doki\N{\c&H8D51EF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H000000&\shad1\fs30}Meowtaro\N{\fs20\fnTrebuchet MS\b0\c&HFBCA68&}~Our Academy of Romance~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:09.87,Sign_Basic,Start Menu Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H26828C&\3c&H79D2E7&\shad0\fs16\move(340,275,340,260)}Start
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:13.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's finally done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:14.50,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:19.13,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,I was hoping to have Shinozaki \Nthe gamer play it for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:21.82,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Well, let's get to it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:22.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:27.13,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HB5C6E9&\shad0\an7\pos(58,60)}Out Front of School
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:27.13,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,230)\fs12\c&HC188E6&\3c&HF4F7F4&\shad0\an1}Meowtaro: {and then the below dialog}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.37,0:05:27.13,Game_Text/Dialogue,Meowtaro,0,0,0,,Hey there. I'm Meowtaro. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:31.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,So you try to romance Meowtaro \Nfrom the perspective of a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:33.05,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:39.06,Game_Text/Dialogue,Meowtaro,0,0,0,,I hear you're quite the cook. \NI'd love to try something you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:41.65,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HB5C6E9&\shad0\an7\pos(39,60)}Restaurant
