Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:41.65,sign_8012_109_Meat_Fish_vegeta,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,112)}Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:41.65,sign_8012_109_Meat_Fish_vegeta,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,144)\fscx80}Vegetables
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:41.65,sign_8012_109_Meat_Fish_vegeta,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,176)}Fruit
