Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:41.65,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,230)\fs12\c&HC188E6&\3c&HF4F7F4&\shad0\an1}Meowtaro:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.51,0:05:41.65,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,You've gotta pick the menu...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:45.58,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Even if he's anthropomorphized, \NMeowtaro's a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:48.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,He probably likes fish, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.50,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Probably!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.61,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Fish it is, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:55.54,sign_8012_109_Meat_Fish_vegeta,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,112)}Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:55.54,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(512.667,138.667)\an8\fs12\c&H65C4EB&\3c&HC2EAFE&\4c&H8EC1E0&}Affection
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:55.66,Game_Text/Dialogue,Meowtaro,0,0,0,,Fish, huh? That's not bad, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:56.16,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,230)\fs12\c&HC188E6&\3c&HF4F7F4&\shad0\an1}Meowtaro:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:57.92,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HB5C6E9&\shad0\an7\pos(39,60)}Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:56.40,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:58.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That wasn't the reaction \NI was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:01.57,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Meowtaro is the heir to a major corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:04.37,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,He eats fish every day, so he's tired of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.37,0:06:06.80,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,I don't think that's part of the backstory...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:09.55,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,The best choice is fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:15.31,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HB5C6E9&\shad0\an7\pos(39,60)}Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:15.31,sign_8012_109_Meat_Fish_vegeta,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,34)}Fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:15.31,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(512.667,138.667)\an8\fs12\c&H65C4EB&\3c&HC2EAFE&\4c&H8EC1E0&}Affection
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:15.31,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,230)\fs12\c&HC188E6&\3c&HF4F7F4&\shad0\an1}Meowtaro:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:11.82,Game_Text/Dialogue,Meowtaro,0,0,0,,I've never had anything like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:15.31,Game_Text/Dialogue,Meowtaro,0,0,0,,You must know about a world \NI'm unfamiliar with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:17.30,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.13,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,What are you all doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:21.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Kurusu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.37,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Office hours are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:25.82,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Why are you all here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:30.57,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,I was having them try out \Nthe Meowtaro game I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.83,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Want to try it, Kurusu-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:35.33,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,A Meowtaro game?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:39.33,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I do! I want to play! Please let me play it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.33,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,230)\fs12\c&HC188E6&\3c&HF4F7F4&\shad0\an1}Meowtaro:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.33,Game_Text/Dialogue,Sign,0,0,0,,I could steal these lips\Nin a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:41.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:43.34,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:46.29,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,This is anthropomorphic hottie Meowtaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:50.09,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,It'll let us develop \Nthe latent otome game market!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:53.05,Italics,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Meowtaro...? Hot...? Anthropomorphic...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.85,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,My Meowtaro... what in the world...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.21,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,This isn't development. It's pandering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:02.85,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,It doesn't convey a fraction of \NMeowtaro's actual appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:07.11,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,It's more likely to chase off \Nexisting fans than develop new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:08.99,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,It's idiocy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:12.22,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Do you really think we can \Nopen up new opportunities
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:14.86,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,by being so beholden to old fans \Nthat we never try anything new?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:16.70,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,It's a question of methodology.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:20.10,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,This would honestly be better off \Nas a completely distinct project...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.62,Main - Top,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Let's keep on playing, Zakishino!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:25.88,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HB5C6E9&\shad0\an7\pos(78,60)}Roof
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:25.88,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(512.667,138.667)\an8\fs12\c&H65C4EB&\3c&HC2EAFE&\4c&H8EC1E0&}Affection
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:25.88,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,230)\fs12\c&HC188E6&\3c&HF4F7F4&\shad0\an1}Meowtaro:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:25.88,Game_Text/Dialogue,Sign,0,0,0,,The culture festival is ending...\NThere's something I need to tell to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:29.05,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Are we gonna get a confession \Nafter the festival?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:32.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. It feels a little too soon \Nfor things to be ending...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.14,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,But it's a private meeting on the rooftop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:37.14,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}On the rooftop...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:39.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meeting in private...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:43.30,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}That sounds familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:47.77,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HB5C6E9&\shad0\an7\pos(78,60)}Roof
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:47.77,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(512.667,138.667)\an8\fs12\c&H65C4EB&\3c&HC2EAFE&\4c&H8EC1E0&}Affection
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:47.77,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(88,230)\fs12\c&HC188E6&\3c&HF4F7F4&\shad0\an1}Meowtaro:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:47.77,Game_Text/Dialogue,Meowtaro,0,0,0,,Let's always be good senpai and kohai, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:49.78,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This line...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:51.78,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}That line...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:55.78,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's always be good coworkers, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.78,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's kinda similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:01.93,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Aw, man, we got rejected before the confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:05.01,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Rejected...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:07.04,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Before confessing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.21,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Rejected?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:11.63,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Before confessing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:15.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I rejected him?! \NThat's not what I was trying to do...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:19.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that what Shinozaki-san felt at the time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:22.92,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really was rejected?! \NThat's what really happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:27.06,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}And after I had tried to forget all about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.32,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,What's with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:35.20,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Hold it right there. It's too soon to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:38.20,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,I know you two must have realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:42.20,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,There's still a while before the ending, \Nand you haven't confessed yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:46.49,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,So you can still seal the deal yet! \NYour chance is still out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.71,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Or do you mean to tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:51.84,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,that you two don't love Meowtaro that much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:53.97,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,I mean, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:56.31,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hadn't confessed yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:58.85,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's still a chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.01,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hadn't confessed yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:03.61,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's still a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:07.30,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's right! We haven't been rejected yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:09.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:12.22,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Is there a reason you guys are so into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:15.11,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,It's not even the real Meowtaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:18.26,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That video game was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:19.62,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.68,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I liked how they ended up \Ntogether in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:23.62,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:27.94,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:33.38,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What was it that you wanted to tell me before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:49.10,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I was wondering if we'd always \Njust be a senpai and a kohai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:10:04.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I remember saying that we should always \Njust be good coworkers before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:07.21,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:13.85,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Maybe now, it'd be okay if things changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:20.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Like, for instance...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:23.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We... We...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:26.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We could be... friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I mean, we already get along well, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:34.78,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:40.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Does that mean you wouldn't mind if we spent \Nmore time together in our personal lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:44.83,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:47.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I can invite you out shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:48.52,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And for lunch on days off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:53.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,If anything, I'd think that's \Na natural thing for friends to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:57.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,A-And if I send you a text asking \N"Are you busy?" for no reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:11:00.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We're friends, so it's not a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:03.10,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We could send pictures of us wearing \Nnew clothes we've bought!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:06.72,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That sounds like the kind of thing \Nfriends should do together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:11.48,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Because we're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:19.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.19,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yes, we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:24.70,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so they've obtained the new \Nrationalization... of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:29.44,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,H-Hang on, Manager! Don't turn into \Nsugar and blow away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:29.44,Main - Top,Manager,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:33.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Tiny Senpai{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:42.01,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(190.667,6.667)\an8\fs20\c&H312E3E&\3c&HF5FDFB&\shad0\bord3\b1\fs18}Sunpick 40th Anniversary
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:39.90,Main,Shinozaki/Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Tiny Senpai{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.21,Main,Everyone else,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.67,0:11:46.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.69,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:51.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:54.27,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Senpai and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:56.63,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shinozaki-san and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.35,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}are friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:05.03,Sign_Basic,Office Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(424,142,453,142)\an9\c&H455051&\bord0\shad0\b1}Product Development
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:05.03,Main,Office Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(424,212,453,212)\an9\c&H2C3437&\bord0\shad0\b1\fs20}Group 2
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:05.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not just coworkers...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:07.59,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}But a personal relationship, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.09,0:12:11.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I've uploaded the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:14.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay. Let me just confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.83,0:12:19.11,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Senpai and I are friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:22.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shinozaki-san and I are friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.19,0:12:24.19,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:26.17,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.25,0:12:29.68,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing's changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:33.44,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to take her out for dinner or something \N outside work, but don't know when to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:36.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bought new clothes \Nand even took selfies in them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.44,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I don't know when \NI should send them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.44,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, I've never had a female friend before!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:44.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, I've never had a male friend before!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:47.45,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}How exactly do I do anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:50.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know how to do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:52.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}If only we had...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}If only we had...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:59.97,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}even the slightest new development...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.69,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Sounds like Okinawa was pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.69,0:13:11.22,Main,Yamagihsi(M),0,0,0,,Tell me about it. Everywhere \NI turned, people were in heat...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:12.88,Main - Top,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Is it all right that I'm joining for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:16.86,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sure. We should get together\Nfor lunch every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:19.07,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:24.37,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to make something happen, \Nbut I'm not sure how to approach it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.09,0:13:29.61,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to make something happen, \Nbut I'm not sure how to approach it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:32.11,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}The timing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:36.01,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Still, I'm sure getting \Nto go to Okinawa was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.01,0:13:38.18,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Are you feeling a bit more refreshed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:39.87,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,I guess a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:45.26,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Golden Week is coming up soon, \Nso I'd like to go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:48.01,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Hey, do any of you have plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:49.58,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}This timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:53.77,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm not really doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:57.38,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,But it'd be nice to go out with some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.85,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\pos(134,280)\b1\fnComic Sans MS\c&H020202&\3c&HFDFFFD&\shad0\bord3}Obvious Bait
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.91,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Nothing on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:04.50,Main - Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But I'd really like to have fun with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:04.86,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\pos(510,280)\b1\fnComic Sans MS\c&H020202&\3c&HFDFFFD&\shad0\bord3}Obvious Bait
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:07.42,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now I know they don't have any plans...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:09.87,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,I'm not doing jack, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:15.12,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,I've got some. Every year, I go to \Nan amusement park with a friend from high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.87,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}An amusement park?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:18.87,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,We wear matching outfits...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.43,0:14:22.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Matching outfits...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:23.63,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.63,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,And then buy merchandise to \Ncommemorate the occasion...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:29.26,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Commemorative merch...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.13,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:34.90,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Going to an amusement park sounds fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:37.89,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's like friendship utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:41.56,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,You think? There are a lot of people \Nwith their kids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:45.01,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,But we're doing something extra this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:46.40,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Check this out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:49.91,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,We've reserved a room at the park's hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.16,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}H-Hotel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:56.16,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,There's a private lounge with a bar where \Nyou can look at the park while drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:59.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}A private lounge with a bar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:02.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:05.55,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Here's to looking at you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:11.43,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,We sit on the bed and talk about the day...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:13.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}On the bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:16.51,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.42,0:15:19.94,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,This was a lot of fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:25.94,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,And then we wrap it up by enjoying \Nthe room's open air bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:30.49,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}T-Together...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:33.95,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}in a bath?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:35.40,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,And then in the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:36.79,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Yamagishi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:40.82,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Tthat seems a little unsavory, \Neven for friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's right! I-I mean, bathing together...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:45.88,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Seems pretty normal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.93,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I just think it's a little too soon for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:50.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Maybe after the relationship's matured some!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.73,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.73,0:15:53.02,Main,Both,0,0,0,,We do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:55.54,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Oh, wait, are you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.97,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,embarrassed about bathing around others?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.22,0:16:07.16,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.63,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'd be kind of glad to, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.27,0:16:11.24,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\b1\fnComic Sans MS\c&H020202&\3c&HFDFFFD&\shad0\bord3\pos(162.667,36)}These two are actually lewd
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:14.17,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,I mean, I've known her since high school, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:16.33,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,A friend from your school days, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.37,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,That sounds like a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.05,0:16:21.94,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}The hotel took me by surprise, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:24.75,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}an amusement park... That really sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:28.25,Main,Shinozai,0,0,0,,{\i1}It might be too soon for a hotel, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:30.76,Main,Shinozai,0,0,0,,{\i1}an amusement park? Nice idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Talking about it has made me want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:35.72,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:36.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:37.74,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:41.85,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Theme parks are the domain \Nof other characters...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:47.38,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Money earned from Meowtaro... \Ncan't be spent on others... ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:50.93,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Do you not like amusement parks, Kurusu-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:52.14,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.53,0:16:56.53,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H8A9BDD&\3c&H91F6B2&\shad0\frz4.395\pos(294.666,186.667)}Meowtaro Land Project Outline
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:55.26,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I wanna make Meowtaro Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:56.53,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,So if anything, you love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.98,0:16:58.42,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,In that case, shouldn't you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:00.91,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,check other places out \Nas a way of gathering intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:04.66,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Instead of trying to make \Nsomething from scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:07.89,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,it'd be a good idea to use \Na successful model as reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:09.61,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It'll help you come up \Nwith unique ideas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:11.35,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,That's a fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:15.68,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,In that case, since it's come up, \Nwhy don't we all go during Golden Week?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:17.55,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,All of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.65,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:22.31,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's all go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:25.82,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Okay, then! If we're all going, I wanna go, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:27.26,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,So, when should we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.91,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.82,Sign_Basic,Calendar signs,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HF3F6F3&\frz354\move(442,42,386,42)\frx40\fry356}May
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.82,Sign_Basic,Calendar signs,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\c&H4228E7&\fs16\frz354.3\move(112.667,90.667,56.667,90.667)}Sunday         {\c&H393C39&}Monday        Tuesday      Wednesday     Thursday         Friday           {\c&HCD4251&}Saturday
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.82,Sign_Basic,Calendar signs,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\move(558,308,502,308)\frz353.4\c&H718884&\3c&HE4FDFA&\shad0}Hayakawa X\NKatase X
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.82,Sign_Basic,Calendar signs,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\frz353.4\c&H718884&\3c&HE4FDFA&\shad0\move(658,286,602,286)}Shinozaki X
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.82,Sign_Basic,Calendar signs,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz353.4\c&H718884&\3c&HE4FDFA&\shad0\fnArial\move(84,302.667,28,302.667)}Yamagishi ♀ X\NHayakawa X
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.82,Sign_Basic,Calendar signs,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz353.4\c&H718884&\3c&HE4FDFA&\shad0\fnArial\move(172.667,312.667,116.667,312.667)}Yamagishi ♂ X\NKurusu X
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.27,0:17:34.35,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I guess our schedules don't match up...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:38.17,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Guess we won't be able \Nto all go during Golden Week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.05,0:17:43.33,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Well, what about during summer vacation, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:45.74,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Since there's more time until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.74,0:17:48.14,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,it should be easier \Nto make our schedules match.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:50.26,Main,Yamagishi(F),0,0,0,,It's on hold, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:57.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I wanted to go to that amusement park...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:17:59.69,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:02.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.99,0:18:09.39,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,U-Um, I know the scheduling \Ndidn't work out for everyone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:13.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Would you... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:21.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,as friends... we could...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:29.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What Yamagishi-san was talking about \Nsounded nice! So... maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:30.58,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,The amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:36.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's go to the amusement park together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:47.06,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:52.14,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,You said you were always free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:54.57,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,But then you had a day \Nwhere you couldn't... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:58.15,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Well, let's just chalk it up \Nto doing the bro thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:06.55,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,The cute shoes I bought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:09.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,or the sneakers I've broken in...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:20.43,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H4D4F4F&\move(360,83,360,95)\q2\fs16\an5\3c&HF0F3F2&\shad0\frz353.4\t(\fs12)}Picking the right look for visiting an amusement park with that special someone\N{\c&HF1F4F3&\3c&H2FE7A5&}Share    {\3c&HEF7593&}Tweet    {\3c&H7F4DE2&}Like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:21.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:28.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The fashionable look...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:31.23,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Or the casual one...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:34.22,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Which should I go with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:35.50,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,You got a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:38.35,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Don't just show up like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:44.42,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,You  always spend Golden Week every year \Nback at home, but this year you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:46.70,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,So I came to check on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:50.21,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,I see... a date with Shiorin, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:54.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's not a date! We're just going to \Nthe amusement park together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:57.09,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Sounds like... a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:19:58.60,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Well, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:01.02,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I haven't confessed to her \Nor started going out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:04.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We're really just going as friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:05.49,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Then, you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.09,0:20:08.85,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,going to an amusement park \Nis something that friends do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:10.58,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:17.61,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H9D8D8B&\bord0\b1\fs18\shad0\frx6\fry28\frz350.5\move(320,362,320,188)}Amusement Park Gate
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.62,0:20:17.61,Italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,Amusement Park Gate, Amusement Park Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.06,0:20:26.58,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I got here faster than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:28.74,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe I should find a café...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.51,0:20:33.69,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess we were on the same train.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:35.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:38.01,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I woke up a bit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.01,0:20:40.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,M-Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:43.13,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You seem different from usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:47.37,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Your hair's up, and you're wearing pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.11,0:20:51.77,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, it's an amusement park...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:54.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I figured we'd be walking a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:57.02,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I've got sneakers on, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:59.02,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:03.53,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We'll probably be walking more than \Nsome hiking trips, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:07.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.39,0:21:10.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We're a little early, but let's get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.41,0:21:12.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:27.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's a senpai where I work...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:29.49,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}who is tiny and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:37.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I guess we should head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:47.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,How about it? \NSomething to remember the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:51.81,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-It's been a while since I've been \Nto an amusement park with a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:53.02,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Do you not want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:54.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I didn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:56.08,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Want me to take it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:57.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Thank you so—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.29,0:21:58.72,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Manager?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:01.79,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Along with my sister and Hayakawa?! \NWhy are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:05.38,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Li'l bro, you said as much yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:08.37,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Amusement parks are for visiting with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.81,0:22:09.80,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,And thus...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.19,0:22:13.21,Flashback,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Chihiro, let's go to the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:15.12,Flashback,Manager,0,0,0,,Let's invite Hayakawa-san, too, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.12,0:22:17.31,Flashback,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Huh? The amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.85,0:22:21.56,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,And so, the three of us had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:20.89,Flashback,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why am I here...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.93,0:22:23.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I... see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.97,0:22:26.31,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Okay, now get closer together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.95,0:22:35.45,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,Shiorin! Shiorin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.25,0:22:35.45,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san, did you enjoy yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:37.73,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Well... I guess I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:40.91,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Things got kind of busy \Nat the end there, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:40.15,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thinking of coming again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.61,0:22:41.97,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,{\an8}I guess I am.
